    "scope": "All 78 captures from Wave 4 qualification runs 44239785990 and 44239805102 on main c703023, which agree on every digest. 76 differ from the previous approvals (d5a077d, runs 43746149035/43746169619); event-why-inspector@390x844 on both backends is unchanged.",
    "findings": "Every file was inspected at its viewport and backend and pixel-diffed against the previous approved capture. Every change traces to one of two causes. First, the world id in the World select, heading and title (worldid_2aff39ee\u2026 to worldid_fec2fe94\u2026), which follows from the fixture pack moving to clockgrove.fixture-hall@1.3.0 (#355) and its other changes (#354, #363); the HUD clock group shifts 1 px with the select's width. Second, the herb now sways at the medium and high tiers, because the presentation declares sway (#363); the low tier has no wind and shows no change. Rendering is clean, and WebGL2 parity is unchanged from the previous approvals."
